        "original_id": "891f1333-de3f-536d-8c12-a2df8c7a29a8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kid Rock, Sheryl Crow, Allison Moorer\n- Works: Cocky, \"Picture\", \"Lonely Road of Faith\", \"Love Is Free\"\n- Companies: Atlantic, Crow's label\n- Topics: singles, duets, radio re-recordings, songwriting\n\nFacts:\n- Kid Rock's 2001 album \"Cocky\" features the ballad \"Picture\" as a duet with Sheryl Crow.\n- \"Lonely Road of Faith\" was the second single released from Kid Rock's 2001 album \"Cocky\".\n- Kid Rock re-recorded \"Picture\" for radio with Allison Moorer because Atlantic initially could not obtain rights from Sheryl Crow's label to release the album version as a single.\n- \"Love Is Free\" is a song written and recorded by American singer-songwriter Sheryl Crow.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
